        }
      ],
      "title": "家主大人终章·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "4350001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "怎么样，是不是一模一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4350002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "真的和没有撞破之前一模一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4350003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "还有这个，这是给你准备的新店钥匙，东西南北各一间，你什么时候想要搬过去都可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4350004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "艾伦兹，我可以不要这些新店，只要你实现我的一个愿望吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4350005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "说出你的愿望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "哇，真的好漂亮，我飞起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "快看快看，从这里可以看到整座城市。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "难怪你之前用那么猥琐的目光看我的龙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "不觉得在天空中飞行的感觉很好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "谢谢你，艾伦兹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "你当然要谢谢我。我的龙可从不让别人触碰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "对了，你让管家带着一车车的宝石去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4351008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "一个有趣的人的住所。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "叮咚——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人，有客人来访。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，我们会躲好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "4352005",
              "text": "开门"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "4352004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "你好，我来自柯斯顿城，是柯斯顿城堡，艾伦兹·珀尔，高贵家主龙王大人的管家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "这是我的主人为答谢你的雨伞，赠与您的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "4352008",
              "text": "龙王大人是谁"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "4352007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "龙王大人是上古龙族的继承血脉，拥有高傲尊贵的血统。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "她也曾有过一位和您一样令她珍惜之人，不过人族的寿命稍纵易逝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "在这之后，艾伦兹大人就一直代替那位守护着城市。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "虽然其他地域的人觊觎着龙王和她的城堡，但谁都没有成功过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "之后漫长的岁月，那位的后代一个又一个消失了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "龙王从此长居城堡中，只有当城市遭到入侵，才会现身于人前。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "4352015",
              "text": "谢谢你的礼物。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "4352014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "猪猪",
          "text": "我先告退了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "走了吗？这里面的是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "是谁送过来的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "4352019",
              "text": "一位口是心非的家主"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "4352019",
              "text": "一位高贵的家主"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "4352018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊~主人太坏了。快给我们说说嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4352020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "说嘛说嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
